      "message": "Fix the expiry test: widen the window and use the ethers provider for chain time\n\nThe short-dated mandate was granted with a 3-second expiry, which the\nmining block had already passed - the test failed on its own setup, not\non the contract. Widened to 45s.\n\nhardhat v3's connection exposes no .provider; chain-time control lives on\nthe ethers plugin. Both fixes take the suite to 28 passing.",
