        "date": "2026-09-29T18:41:38Z"
      },
      "message": "Mandate: scoped, capped, expiring, revocable permissions for AI agents\n\nContract (Solidity 0.8.24, no dependencies):\n- grant / recordAction / revoke / extend\n- explicit custom errors for every refusal\n- revocation is final by design\n\nTests: 20 checks against an in-memory EVM, covering every way an agent\ncould act outside its mandate - over the cap, after expiry, after\nrevocation, as the wrong agent, against an unknown mandate, zero amount,\nand non-principal attempts to revoke or extend.\n\nBrand: monogram mark built from four bars with the inner vertex solved\nas the intersection of the two inner edges rather than offset by hand,\nemitting SVG and raster from one shared geometry.\n\nSite: self-contained landing page on Linear's design system.",
